Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] test(kanban): isolate creator cleanup predicate
 boundaries

Keep target-tamper assertions aligned with authenticated result routing: a refusal for a different target cannot settle the original request. Exercise no-creator missing requester, capability-owner scope, missing target and non-triage controls. Focused proof: 42 tests pass; eight additional predicate cases pass.
